      "body": "Reduced English runtime for Pi's `higgsfield-specialist`: 120 files, preserving all 36 skills, production references/templates, dated service schemas, operational memory, and delivery preflight helpers.\n\nRemoved 106 files, approximately 61% of the installed byte size: skill-development tests and fixtures, evaluations, CI, Claude-specific configuration, archives, PDF tooling/fonts, older catalog snapshots, and unused scaffolding. Production parameter/prompt checks remain. The complete upstream package is not preserved in this repository.\n\nChanges, upstream MIT attribution, and delivery-check evidence are documented in [CHANGES.md](https://github.com/rodrigojager/higgsfield-skill-runtime/blob/main/CHANGES.md). The ZIP contains only the reduced `higgsfield/` runtime folder, matching the installed global copy under `~/.agents/skills/higgsfield`.\n\nThe main and delegated Pi profile both resolve all 36 skills. No paid service generation was performed during this reduction. Service sign-in is still required before production.\n"
